protocol files: 'http://' \, etc.;
#X text 240 202 If local paths are used instead of an URI \, template
parameters can be used \, which are replaced with their corresponding
directories. For example \, '%HOME%' or '~' at the beginning of a path
is replaced with the path to the user's home folder. %VIDEO% on MacOS
is replaced with /Users/_user_/Movies \, and so on.;
